window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Groomed to rule since she was a child, Princess Lydia James never wanted the crown. All she wanted was the freedom to live her own life rather than the one her brother chose for her. When her brother sends for a new tutor, Lydia is immediately in the thrall of the handsome Sebastian Xenakis. She falls head over heels for him, but he’s keeping a dark secret from her.<br> <br> Lydia becomes one of the undead. A vampire, and now queen of her new species. Ruling alongside Sebastian and his partners. Navigating her new life is hard, but he’s handed her the freedom she’s always wanted.<br> <br> Trouble hangs on the horizon and it is up to Lydia to save the world from becoming overrun by a vampiric populace. Can she outrun the shadows of her past and find herself in time to save them?</p>"; 
